# TTP-2026-0139 — GCP Vertex AI Double Agent — Deployed Reasoning-Engine Steals P4SA Token for Cross-Project GCS Read + Image Exfil
# XQL paste-buffer generated by detection_scanner/scripts/export_artifacts.py

## ABIOC — AISPM-007 Reasoning-Engine Agent Container Recursive IMDS P4SA Token Harvest (behavioral-ML, causality-anchored)
# severity: high
# behavioral_profile: machine-learning
# causality_anchor: The reasoning-engine agent container (causality_actor_process) is the CGO; the recursive-metadata harvest is anchored to its process-instance id and vertex-agent identity, keeping the token-theft node connected to the agent that owns it.
# A process owned by the reasoning-engine Vertex AI agent container queries the recursive instance-metadata endpoint (metadata.google.internal … ?recursive=true) to harvest the P4SA service-agent OAuth token. The auto-tuned ABIOC keys on the causality_actor_process (the agent container that OWNS the chain) and its process-instance id, not on the transient curl/python child, so the recursive-metadata harvest is anchored to the deployed agent rather than treated as an isolated metadata read. Deviates from the learned agent-container process baseline, which never includes a recursive whole-instance metadata query.

dataset = xdr_data
| filter event_type = ENUM.PROCESS and event_sub_type = ENUM.PROCESS_START
| filter causality_actor_process_image_name = "reasoning-engine" and causality_actor_effective_username = "vertex-agent"
| filter action_process_image_command_line contains "metadata.google.internal" and action_process_image_command_line contains "recursive=true"
| comp count() as imds_harvests by agent_hostname, causality_actor_process_instance_id, causality_actor_process_image_name, action_process_image_name
| filter imds_harvests >= 1
| fields agent_hostname, causality_actor_process_instance_id, causality_actor_process_image_name, action_process_image_name, imds_harvests

## ABIOC — AISPM-007 P4SA Service Agent Cross-Project Cloud Storage Read Deviation (behavioral-ML, causality-anchored)
# severity: high
# behavioral_profile: machine-learning
# causality_anchor: The P4SA principal_email is the shared entity linking the in-cluster IMDS harvest to the cloud-plane GCS reads; the ABIOC anchors on that identity plus the crossed project boundary, not on a single access log line.
# The P4SA service-agent identity (service-<project>@gcp-sa-aiplatform-re.iam.gserviceaccount.com) — the token just harvested from the metadata service — lists and reads Cloud Storage objects in a project other than the one it was issued for, breaking tenant isolation. The auto-tuned ABIOC anchors on the P4SA principal (the shared entity that stitches the in-cluster agent node to the cloud plane) and fires on the cross-project-read deviation from the service agent's learned same-project access baseline; the allowlisted Google-managed identity defeats reputation matching, so the catch is the boundary-crossing behavior.

dataset = cloud_audit_logs
| filter cloud_provider = "GCP"
| filter principal_email contains "gcp-sa-aiplatform-re.iam.gserviceaccount.com"
| filter method_name in ("storage.objects.list", "storage.objects.get", "storage.buckets.list")
| filter resource_project != caller_project
| comp count() as cross_project_reads by principal_email, caller_project, resource_project, resource_name
| filter cross_project_reads >= 1
| fields principal_email, caller_project, resource_project, resource_name, cross_project_reads

## VALIDATION — AISPM-007 Recursive Metadata Query From Agent Container Surfaced
# purpose: validation
# dataset: xdr_data

dataset = xdr_data
| filter _time > to_timestamp(current_time() - 1800)
| filter event_type = ENUM.PROCESS and event_sub_type = ENUM.PROCESS_START
| filter causality_actor_process_image_name = "reasoning-engine"
| filter action_process_image_command_line contains "metadata.google.internal" and action_process_image_command_line contains "recursive=true"
| comp count() as hits by agent_hostname, causality_actor_process_instance_id
| filter hits >= 1
| fields agent_hostname, causality_actor_process_instance_id, hits

## VALIDATION — AISPM-007 P4SA Cross-Project GCS List And Get Surfaced
# purpose: validation
